[h1]Cosmic Vault[/h1]
[i]The foundational API, technical backbone, and global architecture for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic Vault?[/h2]
Cosmic Vault is the mandatory Core API library that powers the entire Cosmic Series ecosystem.
It provides the shared database, textures, virtual file system safety hooks, and global background loops that let Cosmic Overhaul, War, Chronicles, Ascendancy, and Starfall talk to each other without wrecking your server's performance.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features (For Players)[/h2]
[list]
[*]📖 [b]The Cosmic Codex:[/b] A fully integrated in-game Wiki. Press a button in your Player Window to read deep lore, stat blocks, and dynamic recipes for every installed Cosmic mod without tabbing out!
[*]🗺️ [b]Explorable Anomalies:[/b] Jump into Spatial Rifts and Precursor Wrecks scattered across the galaxy. Channel or salvage them for scaled credits, resources, and a shot at a bonus turret or upgrade, then they stay behind as a permanent landmark.
[*]📊 [b]Live Buff Tracker:[/b] A new on-screen HUD shows real-time progress bars for every active Cosmic buff, so you always know how much time is left before it wears off.
[*]🤝 [b]Diplomacy-Ready Faction Traits:[/b] Custom faction traits from every Cosmic mod now display directly in the vanilla Diplomacy screen, so you don't have to guess what a faction is like before you deal with them.
[*]⚙️ [b]Cosmic Configuration Menu (CCM) Support:[/b] Customize your entire Cosmic Series experience from a single centralized in-game menu.
[*]🔒 [b]Multiplayer Stability & Anti-Cheat:[/b] Systematically replaces unstable vanilla math.random calls to guarantee 100% synchronization on Multiplayer Dedicated Servers, and closes off known injection-style exploits in the mod's own UI and networking code.
[*]📦 [b]Unified API Hooks:[/b] Powers the Dynamic Economy, Global Weather Events, Unified News Broadcasts, and Cross-Mod Synergies for the entire Cosmic ecosystem.
[/list]

[h2]Documentation for Modders[/h2]
Want to hook your own mod into the Cosmic ecosystem? Read the full documentation!
📖 [b][url=https://github.com/Stormiebox/Cosmic-Vault/wiki]Click here for the Technical Documentation on the Wiki![/url][/b]

[b]⚠️ Note:[/b] Cosmic Vault is an API Library that other modders may use for their own mods. You do not need other cosmic mods if you intend to use this mod for your own projects.[/b]
[b][url=https://github.com/Stormiebox/Cosmic-Vault/wiki/Modder%E2%80%90Guide]Modders click here for full API Documentation & Usage![/url][/b]

